{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"6015003050020","name":"甜花","text":"甜花……まだ、ゲームオーバーじゃない……！","trans":"我……还没有游戏结束……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003050030","name":"甜花","text":"コンティニュー……\r\nできた……！","trans":"继续游戏……\n成功了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ、決勝進出だ！\r\nもう一度、頑張ろう！","trans":"是啊，进入决赛了！\n再努力一次吧！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003050050","name":"甜花","text":"今度は……\r\n今度、こそ……！","trans":"这次……\n这次，一定……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015003050060","name":"甜花","text":"甜花……！\r\nちゃんと、頑張る……！","trans":"我……！\n会好好努力的……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}